    "text": "UML class diagram of the Software profile. The abstract SoftwareArtifact (contentIdentifier, primaryPurpose, additionalPurpose, copyrightText, attributionText) specialises Core/Artifact; Package (packageVersion, downloadLocation, packageUrl, homePage, sourceInfo), File (contentType, name[1], fileKind) and Snippet (byteRange, lineRange, snippetFromFile File[1]) specialise SoftwareArtifact. Sbom (sbomType SbomType[0..*]) specialises Core/Bom, and ContentIdentifier (contentIdentifierType[1], contentIdentifierValue anyURI[1]) specialises Core/IntegrityMethod. Enumerations: ContentIdentifierType, FileKindType, SbomType, SoftwarePurpose.",
